-- ============================================================================
-- pin_drop_hanover.sql -- Pin Drop's Hanover map (Nov 28 2026): 44 places
-- from Randy's list (Hanover Shoe Farms left out: just south of the map).
--
-- The map is public/maps/hanover-map.svg, drawn from OpenStreetMap data; a
-- code plays it once "Hanover" is ticked under its Pin Drop maps on /admin.
-- prompt = what the round asks (NULL = the label); label = the reveal.
-- CLUE rows are places that are gone ("Where was the old Anchor Inn?").
-- Circles (radius_miles): 0.03 (~160 ft) a building, 0.05 a small factory,
-- 0.06-0.08 a field, school or park, 0.1 a big plant or the old mall.
-- Difficulty: 1 anyone in town finds it, 2 most locals, 3 regulars,
-- 4 deep local knowledge.
--
-- COORDINATES ARE A FIRST DRAFT from Randy's list: Wirt Park and Codorus
-- State Park check out against OpenStreetMap, but Moul Field sits ~1/3 mile
-- from OSM's outline of it, so expect a few more off. Fix pins in the
-- coming pin editor (or edit lat/lon here and re-run).
--
-- Needs pin_drop_local.sql (already run). SAFE TO RE-RUN: each place is
-- added or updated by (kind, label).
-- ============================================================================


-- Check: 44 Hanover places by difficulty.
SELECT difficulty, COUNT(*) FROM pin_drop_places WHERE map_key = 'HANOVER' AND active GROUP BY difficulty ORDER BY difficulty;
